        },
        {
          "name": "Path Through Shadows",
          "text": "Once per battle, at the start of her Controlling Player's Movement Phase, Sylandri and any Unit she has joined may be removed from the Battlefield and set up again anywhere wholly within 18\" of their previous position and more than 6\" from any enemy Model. They count as having moved, and may not Rush or have a Charge declared for them in the same turn. They may not do so while Locked in Combat or Embarked."
        }
      ],
